SWS484_1&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;SWS484_2&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;SWS484_3&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\">assembly</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;~/new94/new94.consensus.fasta&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;~/new94/new94.consensus.fasta&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;~/new94/new94.consensus.fasta&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;~/sws484/sws484.consensus.fasta&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;~/sws484/sws484.consensus.fasta&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;~/sws484/sws484.consensus.fasta&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\">treatment</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br><br>meth</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">unite</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">myobj</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> destrand</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">FALSE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></div></code></div><div><br>However, when I try to unite the objects I get the following error: </div><div><pre style=\"font-family:&quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;;outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:16px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:10.4pt!important;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\">Error in vapply(object, function(x) x@assembly, FUN.VALUE = &quot;character&quot;) : \r\n  values must be length 1,\r\n but FUN(X[[1]]) result is length 6</span></pre></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>Any help you can provide is greatly appreciated,</div><div>Muna<br><br></div></div>"
